# `.env` is deliberately *not* ignored: `composer dump-env prod` reads it during the build and fails without it. What
# is ignored is everything that layers a local value over it, because those hold the secrets `make setuplocalenv`
# writes and `dump-env` would bake them into the image.
.env.*.local
.env.local
.env.local.php
.env.test
composer.phar
Makefile
